{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Living Longer Better", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Secret of Longevity", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Grammar - part 3 > Yes  Agnes", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Simple Present and Continuous Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense and the Present Continuous tenses to talk about the present in different ways.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present </span> tense:  <ul><li>to talk about things that are always true </li><li>to give general information </li><li>to talk about habits and routines </li><li>to talk about feelings (stative verbs)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous</span> tense: <ul><li>to talk about an action happening now </li><li> to talk about things happening around now </li><li>to talk about things that are changing", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">People live longer in North America today.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Today, Americans are living longer.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They go to school three days a week.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They are going back to school.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Seniors who visit the doctor regularly also live longer.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My grandmother is seeing the doctor next week.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Necessity and Advisability", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about what is necessary, you use <span class=\"italic\">have got to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">going to have to</span>.<br><br>When you talk about what is advisable, you use <span class=\"italic\">need to, should, ought to,</span> and <span class=\"italic\">had better.</span> ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Necessity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Advisability\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If we can't go to the gym, we've got to at least get out and walk. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">To live longer, we should continue to learn.  </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We're going to have to stay physically active.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We ought to travel. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Finally we've got to look at our diets. </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We had better take the recommended medication. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "alert", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quick to see and understand  ", "type": "definition"}, {