larly also live longer. Of course, we ought to follow our doctor's advice!  Also, we had better take the recommended medication. Finally, we've got to look at our diets. Most of us ought to reduce the number of sweets we eat.  We're going to have to cut down on red meat consumption as well. Ideally we ought to look at our health and lifestyle. We had better do this sooner than later. To live longer healthy lives, we've got to make those changes now.", "time": "30000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}